      "content": "How do the $\\text{H}_3\\text{O}^+(\\text{aq})$ concentration of $\\text{HC}\\ell(\\text{aq})$ and the $\\text{pH}$ of $\\text{HC}\\ell(\\text{aq})$ compare to that of $\\text{CH}_3\\text{COOH}(\\text{aq})$?"
